<title>USA: USDA gross cutout hide and offal value.</title>
<headline>USDA gross cutout hide and offal value.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The hide and offal value from a</p>
<p>typical slaughter steer for today was estimated at $9.62 per cwt</p>
<p>live, up 0.07 when compared to Thursday's value. - USDA</p>
<p>FOB CENTRAL U.S., TODAY'S CALCULATIONS FOR BY-PRODUCT VALUE</p>
<p>(STEER) -			  Lbs    Price  Change    Value</p>
<p>Steer hide, butt brand	 5.40   86.50    1.00    5.99</p>
<p>Tallow, edible		   1.20   24.25    -	 0.29</p>
<p>Tallow, packer bleachable    4.50   21.25    -	 0.96</p>
<p>Tongues, Swiss #1 Wht 0-3%   0.26  200.00    -	 0.52</p>
<p>Cheek meat, trmd		 0.32   58.00    -	 0.19</p>
<p>Head meat			  0.13   45.00    1.00    0.06</p>
<p>Oxtail, selected		 0.16  143.00    -	 0.23</p>
<p>Hearts, reg, bone out	  0.38   27.25    -	 0.10</p>
<p>Lips, unscalded		  0.11   72.00    -	 0.08</p>
<p>Livers, slcted, gall off     0.96   35.00    -	 0.34</p>
<p>Tripe, scalded edible	  0.65   18.00    -	 0.12</p>
<p>Tripe, honeycomb bleached    0.15   50.00    -	 0.08</p>
<p>Lungs, inedible		  0.47    4.60    -	 0.02</p>
<p>Melts				0.14    6.25    -	 0.01</p>
<p>Meat bone ml, 50% blk/ton    3.70  257.00    -	 0.48</p>
<p>Blood meal, 85% blk/ton	0.60  510.00   10.00    0.15</p>
<p>TOTAL :			   19.13			  9.62</p>
<p>The average value of hide and offal for the five days ending</p>
<p>Friday, February 14, 1997 was estimated at 9.48 per cwt.,</p>
<p>up 0.17 from last week and up 1.46 from last year.</p>
